OL,3,GNEWSAMarch deadline for council
OL,4,Ashake-up, says minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has said it will make a
OL,7,Ffinal decision on local government
OL,8,Freorganisation (LGR) for Suffolk by
OL,9,FMarch next year.
OL,11,FJim McMahon, the minister for local
OL,12,Fgovernment, devolution and regional
OL,13,Fgrowth, told Parliament on Thursday the
OL,14,Fgovernment was reviewing decisions for
OL,15,F15 councils, including Suffolk.
OL,17,FMcMahon said: "All options and
OL,18,Fproposals in these areas will remain
OL,19,Funder consideration and I'll approach
OL,20,Fall those with an open mind."
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
